menu "Node cycle"
config NODE_DEEP_SLEEP_SECONDS
    int "Deep sleep duration in seconds"
    range 10 900
    default 900
    help
        Production uses 900 seconds. Accelerated RF qualification uses 10.
config NODE_RF_SLEEP_OBSERVATION
    bool "Enable host-controlled RF test finalization"
    default n
    help
        Test builds only: emit a marker after cycle finalization and successful
        timer configuration, then require a nonce-bound host receipt before
        sleep. The final planned wake parks for ROM stop/capture. Missing
        receipt parks until reset; ordinary production leaves this disabled.
config NODE_RF_PHY_OBSERVATION
    bool "Capture passive PHY IRQ observations for RF qualification"
    depends on NODE_RF_SLEEP_OBSERVATION
    default n
    help
        Test builds only: link bounded passive radio wrappers and dump the
        observed IRQ/timing data at finalized sleep entry. Overflow fails RF
        verification. This does not inject events or change receive policy.
endmenu
